@startuml 19-tp-nominal-mission-sequence
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Diagram 19: TP-ST-001 Nominal Mission Test Sequence
' Full 2-drone nominal SITL mission with test assertions
' MC-TP-001 §6 TP-ST-001
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

title "19 — TP-ST-001 Nominal 2-Drone Mission Test Sequence\nGCS Commands · Phase Transitions · Test Assertions  ·  MC-TP-001 §6\n<color:#C02020>Design target — actual TEST-002 harness is single-drone; only PREFLIGHT through TAKEOFF is exercised (see note below)</color>"

skinparam BackgroundColor #FAFBFC
skinparam DefaultFontColor #1C2334
skinparam DefaultFontSize 10
skinparam TitleFontSize 13
skinparam TitleFontStyle bold
skinparam shadowing false

skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #3D5A80
  ArrowFontColor #1C2334
  ArrowFontSize 9
  ParticipantBorderColor #3D5A80
  ParticipantFontSize 10
  ParticipantFontStyle bold
  LifeLineBorderColor #9AB0CC
  BoxLineColor #8AA8C8
  BoxBackgroundColor #F4F8FF
  DividerBackgroundColor #E0EAFF
  DividerBorderColor #3D5A80
  DividerBorderThickness 1
  DividerFontSize 10
  DividerFontStyle bold
  DividerFontColor #1C2334
  GroupBodyBackgroundColor #F8FAFF
  NoteBackgroundColor #FFFAE8
  NoteBorderColor #C09030
  NoteFontSize 9
}

participant "pytest\ntest script" as TEST #D0E8D0
participant "mock_gcs_node\n(GCS)" as GCS #B8DCA8
participant "MC Instance 1\n[Drone 1 — Coordinator]" as MC1 #A8CCEE
participant "MC Instance 2\n[Drone 2]" as MC2 #C8B0E8
participant "FCC SITL 1\n(PX4 SITL)" as FCC1 #FFD4A8
participant "FCC SITL 2\n(PX4 SITL)" as FCC2 #FFE0C0

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
' SETUP
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
== Test Setup: Start SITL, MC stacks, wait for ready ==

note over TEST, FCC2 #FFE0E0
  <b>Status as of 2026-09-08 (test_sitl_mission_scenarios.py, TEST-002):</b>
  This diagram is the TP-ST-001 design target. The actual automated harness
  runs a SINGLE drone (instance 0 only) natively (ros2 launch, no Docker) —
  Drone 2 / MC Instance 2 below does not run. Of the phase transitions shown,
  only test_01 (PREFLIGHT→ARMING) and test_02 (ARMING→TAKEOFF) actually run
  and pass. test_03 through test_09 — everything from TAKEOFF→INGRESS
  onward, including MUSTER, ISR_SELECTION, VORONOI_PARTITION, SEARCH, and
  RETURN/LAND below — are all @unittest.skip'd, blocked on a real PX4 defect
  this harness discovered (FCC-010: PX4 never replies to the FORMATION_SLOT
  partial mission-item update with MISSION_REQUEST_INT, at any known
  firmware version). Fixed 2026-09-14 at the fcc_bridge/mission_exec code
  level (full mission re-upload replaces the partial write, cadence
  lowered to >=2 Hz) but still skipped here pending a real PX4 SITL re-run
  to confirm test_03 onward actually pass now. ISR election
  and Voronoi partitioning are also not really exercised even in the
  skipped tests' design — swarm_coordinator_node/formation_controller_node/
  search_planner_node are still scaffolds; a mock_swarm_coord_node publishes
  just enough to satisfy mission_manager_node's own guards. See
  PROJECT-PLAN-5-MONTH.md's TEST-002 entry for the full writeup.
end note

TEST -> FCC1 : start PX4 SITL instance 1
TEST -> FCC2 : start PX4 SITL instance 2
TEST -> MC1  : docker start drone-mc.target (SIMULATION_MODE=true DRONE_ID=1)
TEST -> MC2  : docker start drone-mc.target (SIMULATION_MODE=true DRONE_ID=2)
TEST -> GCS  : launch mock_gcs_node

MC1 --> TEST : /mc/manager/heartbeat visible ✓
MC2 --> TEST : /mc/manager/heartbeat visible ✓

note over TEST #C8EEC8
  ASSERT: Both MC instances reach PREFLIGHT phase
  within 30 s of service start.
  Timeout: 30 s.
end note

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
' MISSION UPLOAD
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
== Phase: PREFLIGHT — Mission Upload ==

GCS -> MC1 : MISSION_COUNT=15\n→ MISSION_ITEM_INT ×15\n(ingress wpt · muster · 2× formation offset\n 5× polygon vertex · 2× peer entry)
MC1 --> GCS : MISSION_ACK(ACCEPTED)

GCS -> MC2 : MISSION_COUNT=15 → MISSION_ITEM_INT ×15
MC2 --> GCS : MISSION_ACK(ACCEPTED)

note over TEST #C8EEC8
  ASSERT: Both MC instances publish
  /mc/gcs/mission_upload with:
  - waypoint count matches sent items
  - formation offset vectors correct
  - peer manifest contains Drone 1 and Drone 2
end note

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
' ARMING
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
== Phase: PREFLIGHT → ARMING ==

GCS -> MC1 : MC_CMD_ARM_AUTHORISE (50002)\n  param1 = mission_upload_id
MC1 --> GCS : COMMAND_ACK(MAV_RESULT_ACCEPTED)
GCS -> MC2 : MC_CMD_ARM_AUTHORISE (50002)
MC2 --> GCS : COMMAND_ACK(MAV_RESULT_ACCEPTED)

MC1 -> FCC1 : vehicle_command: ARM (400)
MC2 -> FCC2 : vehicle_command: ARM (400)
FCC1 --> MC1 : arming_state = ARMED
FCC2 --> MC2 : arming_state = ARMED

MC1 --> GCS : MC_STATUS: mission_phase = ARMING
MC2 --> GCS : MC_STATUS: mission_phase = ARMING

note over TEST #C8EEC8
  ASSERT: Both MC instances transition to ARMING
  within 5 s of ARM_AUTHORISE.
  ASSERT: COMMAND_ACK latency ≤ 500 ms.
end note

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
' TAKEOFF
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
== Phase: ARMING → TAKEOFF ==

MC1 -> FCC1 : vehicle_command: TAKEOFF (22)\nalt = 50.0 m AGL
MC2 -> FCC2 : vehicle_command: TAKEOFF (22)

FCC1 --> MC1 : nav_state = AUTO_TAKEOFF
FCC2 --> MC2 : nav_state = AUTO_TAKEOFF

FCC1 --> MC1 : vehicle_local_position.z ≈ −50 m (at altitude)
FCC2 --> MC2 : vehicle_local_position.z ≈ −50 m

MC1 --> GCS : MC_STATUS: mission_phase = TAKEOFF
MC2 --> GCS : MC_STATUS: mission_phase = TAKEOFF

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
' INGRESS  (everything below: SKIPPED in the automated suite — see
' the setup-section status note. Kept as the TP-ST-001 design target.)
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
== Phase: TAKEOFF → INGRESS (GCS command) — test_03, SKIPPED ==

GCS -> MC1 : MC_CMD_PHASE_TRANSITION (50001)\n  param1 = PHASE_INGRESS
GCS -> MC2 : MC_CMD_PHASE_TRANSITION (50001)\n  param1 = PHASE_INGRESS

MC1 -> FCC1 : vehicle_command: SET_MODE MISSION\nupload FORMATION_SLOT (Drone 1 = leader)
MC2 -> FCC2 : vehicle_command: SET_MODE MISSION\nupload FORMATION_SLOT (Drone 2 = −10 m behind leader)

note over MC1, MC2
  formation_controller_node active.
  Drone 1 tracks ingress waypoint.
  Drone 2 follows Drone 1 at formation_offset.
end note

FCC1 --> MC1 : position approaching ingress waypoint
FCC2 --> MC2 : position following Drone 1 ± 2 m

MC1 --> GCS : MC_STATUS: mission_phase = INGRESS

note over TEST #C8EEC8
  ASSERT: Both at INGRESS within 10 s of command.
  ASSERT: formation_controller mission-item update rate ≥ 2 Hz (FCC-010)
  on /mc/fcc/mission_item_update (Drone 2).
end note

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
' MUSTER
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
== Phase: INGRESS → MUSTER (FCC waypoint complete) ==

FCC1 --> MC1 : mission item reached (muster waypoint)
FCC2 --> MC2 : mission item reached

MC1 --> GCS : MC_STATUS: mission_phase = MUSTER
MC2 --> GCS : MC_STATUS: mission_phase = MUSTER
MC1 <-> MC2 : SWARM_HEARTBEAT (phase=MUSTER)\n→ quorum = 2/2 met

note over TEST #C8EEC8
  ASSERT: Both at MUSTER within 60 s.
  ASSERT: /mc/swarm/peer_states shows both
  peers in MUSTER state.
end note

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
' ISR SELECTION
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
== Phase: MUSTER → ISR_SELECTION (autonomous) ==

MC1 <-> MC2 : ISR_CANDIDATE (0x10)
MC1 -> MC1  : score Drone 1 and Drone 2
MC1 -> MC2  : ISR_RESULT (0x11)  isr_ids=[1]
MC2 -> MC1  : ISR_RESULT_ACK (0x12)

MC1 --> GCS : MC_STATUS: mission_phase = ISR_SELECTION\nisr_role = ISR_SELECTED
MC2 --> GCS : MC_STATUS: isr_role = SEARCH_RESERVE

note over TEST #C8EEC8
  ASSERT: ISR_SELECTION complete < 15 s.
  ASSERT: Exactly isr_count = ceil(2/2) = 1 drone elected.
  ASSERT: GCS receives isr_role field in MC_STATUS.
end note

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
' VORONOI PARTITION
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
== Phase: ISR_SELECTION → VORONOI_PARTITION (autonomous) ==

MC1 <-> MC2 : VORONOI_PROPOSAL · VORONOI_ACCEPT
MC1 -> MC1  : Fortune's + clip → own cell
MC2 -> MC2  : Fortune's + clip → own cell
MC1 <-> MC2 : consensus check ✓

MC1 --> GCS : MC_STATUS: mission_phase = VORONOI_PARTITION
MC2 --> GCS : MC_STATUS: mission_phase = VORONOI_PARTITION

note over TEST #C8EEC8
  ASSERT: /mc/swarm/voronoi_cell published
  on both instances within 10 s of phase entry.
  ASSERT: sum(cell areas) ≈ search_polygon_area ± 5%.
end note

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
' SEARCH
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
== Phase: VORONOI_PARTITION → SEARCH (autonomous) ==

MC1 -> FCC1 : MAVLink mission upload (boustrophedon path 1)
MC2 -> FCC2 : MAVLink mission upload (boustrophedon path 2)
MC1 -> FCC1 : vehicle_command: SET_MODE AUTO_MISSION
MC2 -> FCC2 : vehicle_command: SET_MODE AUTO_MISSION

FCC1 --> MC1 : nav_state = AUTO_MISSION
FCC2 --> MC2 : nav_state = AUTO_MISSION

MC1 --> GCS : MC_STATUS: mission_phase = SEARCH
MC2 --> GCS : MC_STATUS: mission_phase = SEARCH

note over TEST #C8EEC8
  ASSERT: Both at SEARCH within 20 s of VORONOI done.
  ASSERT: Coverage path generated < 5 s (PR-008).
  ASSERT: FCC mission item count > 60 (adequate coverage).
  ASSERT: MC_DETECTION messages received during search
  (triggered by mock_camera_node's target frame).
end note

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
' END MISSION
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
== Phase: SEARCH → RETURN → LAND (GCS end-mission) ==

GCS -> MC1 : MC_CMD_END_MISSION (50003)
GCS -> MC2 : MC_CMD_END_MISSION (50003)

MC1 -> FCC1 : vehicle_command: RTL (20)
MC2 -> FCC2 : vehicle_command: RTL (20)

FCC1 --> MC1 : nav_state = AUTO_RTL → AUTO_LAND
FCC2 --> MC2 : nav_state = AUTO_RTL → AUTO_LAND

FCC1 --> MC1 : arming_state = STANDBY (disarmed)
FCC2 --> MC2 : arming_state = STANDBY (disarmed)

MC1 --> GCS : MC_STATUS: mission_phase = LAND
MC2 --> GCS : MC_STATUS: mission_phase = LAND

note over TEST #C8EEC8
  ASSERT: Both drones disarmed within 20 min total.
  ASSERT: mission_phase = LAND on both instances.
  ASSERT: No S1 fault events on /mc/fault during entire test.
  ASSERT: MC_STATUS rate ≥ 2 Hz throughout (TP-ST-011).
end note

TEST -> TEST : PASS — all assertions satisfied

@enduml
